much, much worse. And, even though it would be possible to use
computers to keep both systems of indexing going at the same time,
they'd represent different worldviews and take time to learn, so
that people would be fighting for their preferred indexing.

Eventually, you'd probably find layer upon layer of indexing
system--it would be like the Japanese alphabet(s), only worse.

